-+# Verification Audit Narrative: KANBA-117 (KB-P3-52)
-+
-+- **Ticket**: `KANBA-117` (`KB-P3-52`: Standalone status panel: volume persistence, encrypted backup trigger & docker-compose.yml export)
-+- **Author**: `builder-20`
-+- **Worktree**: `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-117`
